WEBVTT

00:20:28.573 --> 00:20:33.727
feel that they can really have 
their own mother tongue use

00:20:33.727 --> 00:20:35.517
to really express their ideas.

00:20:35.517 --> 00:20:39.267
As you know, people are 
really much stronger

00:20:39.267 --> 00:20:41.917
when they express their ideas 
in their native language,

00:20:41.917 --> 00:20:44.642
and they understand much better 
in their native language.

00:20:44.642 --> 00:20:48.642
So, in order for you to do 
that change in that region,

00:20:48.642 --> 00:20:53.448
you need to be able to provide
enough knowledge, enough platform

00:20:53.448 --> 00:20:56.876
for the people to express 
and to learn through their language

00:20:56.876 --> 00:21:01.132
because this the best way 
they can really achieve their potential.